	Wanted across the galaxy, the **Cat Burglar** will gladly stroll off with your valuables, her feline alien heritage making her nimble and stealthy. Just never call her a cat to her face, or you could lose more than your belongings.
		Attributes: Agile +2, Art of Invisibility +2, Attack +1 (Claws), Dexterous +2, Quick +2; Greedy −2, Sensitivity −2 (Being Called a Cat), Wanted −3 (GPL).
